AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0100001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/R_9> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/R_1>)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/R_9> "true"^^xsd:boolean)



